WEBVTT

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.040
<b>The blue sky has broken through</b>

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.040
<b>Come, let's go out</b>

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:28.880
<b>Riding my bike through the usual avenue</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.550
<b>"I want to meet you now."</b>

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:37.100
<b>That thought is blown away by the wind,</b>

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>and becomes a letter being carried to you</b>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:52.360
<b>The story that starts from here... Fly!</b>

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:59.700
<b>Even if the changing seasons walk on with loud footsteps,</b>

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:06.500
<b>the wings of love won't change</b>

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:14.510
<b>Fly far away, high into the sky</b>

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:20.760
<b>May the weather forecast of love be sunny and clear forever</b>

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:28.440
<b>Tomorrow and the day after tomorrow</b>

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:40.780
So hot—

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.450
Umm, Yurie-sama?

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:47.960
Such a graceless look isn't very fitting for a god—

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:54.230
The wooden floor isn't very cool either—

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:55.170
I'm home.

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.100
Good for nothing.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.100
Do your homework, or something.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.020
I'll do it when it's cooler tonight.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:10.690
Hey Shou-chan, get me some ice?

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:11.900
Get it yourself.

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.610
You received some summer greetings.

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:15.740
From who?

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.070
Check for yourself.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:24.160
Yurie, hasn't Tama been acting strange lately?

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.700
She's the same as always.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.920
She was eating watermelons the other day.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.000
Since when can't cats eat watermelons?

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.800
She was sitting on the porch, spitting 
out the seeds from her mouth!

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.800
Are you saying that's normal?

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:42.470
It's hot, you must've seen a mirage.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:44.100
Anyway, the ice!

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.640
I won't accept this!

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:49.890
You can't do that!

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.650
I'm sorry, I just—

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.360
At least get up before you move—

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.780
It's too hot.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:06.330
Truly, this heat is lethal.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:08.750
So, wanna go to the beach?

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.740
Yes!

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.210
Let's go!

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.080
Here's your ice.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:17.090
Shou-chan, I'm going to the 
beach now, I don't need it anymore.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.970
You eat it, Shou-chan!

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:22.720
I won't accept this!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.360
It's so crowded—

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:44.570
It's free, after all—

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.700
We won't be able to have fun like this!

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:47.470
What should we do?

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:49.250
Wanna check out the cove?

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:49.950
Sure.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.410
The cove?

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:54.130
<b>Bus stop</b>

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:54.130
Northern                                         shore

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:54.130
Daytime bus

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.520
Why isn't anybody here?

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:14.400
Because there aren't any changing 
rooms or beach houses either here.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:17.060
Everyone used to come here.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:21.130
But since the other place is closer by and 
a lot of shops have been opened there,

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.780
this place became deserted quickly.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.780
I see—

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:54.850
Yurie! If you go out too far it could be dangerous!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:54.850
Pass!

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:00.320
Can't you catch?

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:03.190
I can't see very well, so I can't help it.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:05.660
Taking off your glasses makes that much of a difference?

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:08.780
They'll grow bad with age anyway!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.410
What are you doing?

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.510
Sea Breeze

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.930
What the hell is this!?

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:28.180
I think it's a rain shower—

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.810
Hey, wanna go inside?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:41.610
Sounds good!

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:43.730
Aren't there any spirits in here?

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.320
I came here to seabathe, not for a courage test—

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.410
Mitsue-chan!?

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.410
Mitsue!?

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.240
I'm fine—

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.170
What do you think?

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.000
Seems there aren't any.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.800
Neither people nor anything else.

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.850
It's as if time has stopped here—

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:17.140
I wonder if it's been like this 
since before we were born—

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.310
What's this?

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.440
What could that be?

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.360
A rubber tire?

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:32.160
It's a swimming tube!

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:33.950
It's a tire!

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.060
They used to use swimming tubes here.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.290
I've seen them in one of Tohru-chan's photo's.

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:39.670
Who's Tohru?

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.090
M-my elder cousin!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:45.800
Is this a swimming tube as well?

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.260
That's a boat.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.220
A rental boat.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.800
I'm going further in!

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.260
This is kinda fun!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:56.470
That's true.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:59.230
Does it only have one tire?

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:00.600
Looks pretty unbalanced.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.700
It's like a museum.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.240
More like a haunted house.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.380
There are a lot of photographs!

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:31.680
In the past, it seems this place was thriving as well.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.180
Isn't this a foreigner?

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:34.850
Where?

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:38.730
Impossible.

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:41.890
No foreigner would ever come to these parts.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.020
But his hair isn't black.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.520
It has to be an old man.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.440
Have you ever seen an old man with a body like this!?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:50.070
It's definitely a foreigner!

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:50.990
I wonder—

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:51.900
Definitely!

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:53.160
It's all gooey—

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.200
Let's see—

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:21.480
I wonder if they broadcasted 
music through that speaker—

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:23.980
It's clearing up.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.370
Let's see—

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.170
Time for another dive!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.310
I see—

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:08.900
So that swimming area has become so deprecated—

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:09.680
Seems like it.

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:12.320
We haven't been there for a while.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.860
We used to go there pretty often in our school days—

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:19.620
Of course! That was the place we met, after all.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:24.080
You looked so dazzling in your bathing suit back then!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.450
Oh my!

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:28.250
Don't say something so embarrassing, Kenkichi-san!

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.030
There's nothing to be embarrassed about!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.090
My back hurts.

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:32.340
Remembering those days, don't you just want to sing?!

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:31.750
It hurts.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.220
It hurts!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.350
Give us a break!

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:39.640
It's annoying!

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.730
Are you going to go swimming again tomorrow, Yurie?

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.520
I'll pass—

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.260
It hurts, my back hurts!

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:53.070
You got what was coming for you for not wearing sunscreen.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:53.730
Shou-chan, ice!

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:54.690
Go get it yourself!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.120
Are you okay?

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.540
I'm not okay!

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.200
What are you saying?

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.330
Good evening!

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.760
We have come to escort you!

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:17.720
Please hurry and get dressed.

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.300
We cannot be late.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.810
Is something up?

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.310
I'm sunburnt so I can't really go out—

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:24.970
Have you not been informed?

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:27.690
Tonight is the meeting of the God Association.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:28.600
Meeting?

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.520
There should have been a letter to inform you—

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:34.020
It was buried under all the summer greetings—

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.580
Yurie-sama's welcoming party.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.910
All gods are welcome.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.450
Invitation of participation?

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.800
Yurie-sama, why are you sneaking around like this?

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.500
You're dense.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.550
Yurie-sama is only a teenager.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:06.220
If her parents catch her going out 
this late at night, it'll cause problems!

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:08.770
You're a god, yet you're vulnerable to your parents.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:09.600
Of course I am!

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.060
What was that?

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.030
It's just Tama.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.320
Tama, come back here!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.870
You can't go out this late at night.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.370
Thanks, Tama.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.210
Let's hurry, Yurie-sama.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:35.600
I am hurrying!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.590
Yurie-sama, watch out for mosquitos!

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.100
I kinda want to go home—

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:59.440
What is the matter, Yurie-sama?

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.400
The pain in my body went away.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:04.240
That is because this is the land of the gods.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.370
Lucky!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.870
Over here, Yurie-sama!

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:11.910
You're the one from before!

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:13.310
Everyone's waiting for you!

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:14.830
Hurry up and hop in!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:15.790
Sure!

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.890
Yurie-sama's welcoming party

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.140
Ladies and gentlemen of divinity,

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.230
thank you for gathering, and welcome.

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:43.570
The festivities today are to welcome our 
new companion Hitotsubashi Yurie-sama,

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:46.820
I ask of you to please give her a warm salute.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.910
N-Nice to meet you.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.500
Well then, let's start by letting 
Yurie-sama introduce herself—

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.590
—is where I'd want to go,

00:12:56.590 --> 00:13:00.730
but first the president of the God Association 
will award the certificatory garment.

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:01.590
Applause!

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.470
President? Garment?

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:12.310
This person is the president?

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:17.020
Well, it looks like you are quite a young one.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:30.490
You think I don't know young people's fashion sense?

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.200
It's wonderful!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:39.080
A new glorious look for our lovely Yurie-sama!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:42.090
My dear audience, applause, applause!

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:45.220
Well then, introduce yourself.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:58.600
Er— um— good evening. I'm Hitotsubashi Yurie.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:01.110
Good evening!

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:04.690
Umm— today is a great day—

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:10.240
I mean— I have become a god recently.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:13.990
But since I'm so inexperienced, 
I've screwed up many times.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:19.580
I want to do my best now that I've become a god.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:23.640
Doing both my schoolwork and my godly duties,

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:26.010
I've somehow managed to pull through first semester.

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.970
I wish to keep doing the same for second semester.

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:32.120
My grades have dropped.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:34.890
Is the god of scholarship present?

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.770
Sugahara-kun is absent.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:44.400
Er— Anyway, pleased to meet you!

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:59.290
Well, we might be gods, but 
there are one-shots like me as well.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.880
Yurie-sama, a picture please!

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:05.460
Sure!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.920
Okay, here goes!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.930
Say sauce!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:21.690
Mr. President, is something going to be 
different now that I've received this garment?

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.610
Well, that's up to you.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:32.530
It is a ceremonial dress that can give you special 
powers, but in the end, it's what's inside that matters.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.580
What a surprise to see you guys here.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.080
It's been a long time since were summoned.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:40.710
Ah, there she is!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.920
Come, have a seat.

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:46.040
I-I'm but a newcomer, but thanks for having me!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:52.430
What kind of gods are all of you?

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.550
I'm the god of tires.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:57.890
As time progressed, I've come to hold the 
position of god of swimming tubes as well.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.470
I'm the god of swimming floats.

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.560
I'm shaved ice.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:02.810
Fried soba here.

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:03.940
God of boats.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.910
Could you people be?

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:12.820
All of us together form the Sea Breeze team.

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:13.950
Thought so!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.400
Because you guys took shelter from the rain there,

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:20.410
we were able to see that 
place again after all these years.

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:23.210
I'm sorry for barging in without asking—

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:28.880
Don't apologize, us gods are happiest 
when we are reminded by people.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.670
But you did believe it was a haunted house for a bit.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.010
Yes, for a bit.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:37.100
I'm sorry.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.320
Don't worry about it.

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:41.930
We've been working hard at that place for a long time.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:42.830
That's right.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:48.360
It's been a long time since then, but we 
are not ashamed, nor do we have regrets.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:49.450
Yeah.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.980
No regrets.

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:54.490
However, there is still something I'm wondering about.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:55.820
What is it?

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:58.700
It's about a certain boy and a girl.

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:00.740
Ah, those two.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:03.080
The boy was really into photography.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:06.880
He was often taking pictures of everyone at the 
beach, and hung them on the walls of the Sea Breeze.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.520
The girl was about three years younger than him—

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:12.340
Probably around the same age as you.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.930
She often used me as a swimming tube 
while trying to learn how to swim.

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:19.370
The two of them became very 
close after they met on that beach.

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:22.470
I've never seen a happier couple before.

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:26.730
I'd really like to know if those two found happiness.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.360
Yeah—

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.110
Hey, newbie.

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:36.660
Don't you want to test out those clothes' abilities?

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:42.330
In return for their hospitality, you might 
consider granting these retirees their wish.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.450
President, you're giving a bad impression!

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:47.330
Yeah, this isn't why we told her at all.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.500
No, please let me do it!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:04.440
This place looks quite lonely at night—

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:05.680
It doesn't hurt—

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.950
It's thanks to those clothes.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:09.310
Well then, what are you gonna do?

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.860
I hope they're still around—

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:34.670
Ka—

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.130
mi—

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:38.130
chu!

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.570
Yurie?

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:03.910
I have to go.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.120
Tohru-niichan?

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:12.670
What's going on?

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.710
I have to go.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:31.560
When they see that, the people in the pictures and 
everyone else who recalls this place will definitely come.

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:34.110
Do you think those two will be here?

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.980
I'm sure they will.

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:41.910
Because I can sense that the person who took 
those photo's loves this place and this town.

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.870
Well then, shall we get fixed up as well?

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:47.990
It'd be rude to receive them like this.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:50.160
How nostalgic!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.720
Yurie-chan?

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:05.760
Yurie?

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:10.270
Mom! Dad! Why are you here?

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:16.190
I somehow felt drawn to this place.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.400
We're ready to open up here!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:24.610
To start with, please invite those two over there.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.290
What are you doing in this place?

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:30.200
What's up with that outfit?

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.290
Can't you see it?

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.170
See what?

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:36.590
You can use your powers to help them.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.590
It's just a simple thing, really.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:41.510
What's wrong?

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:42.800
Not feeling well?

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:45.260
Really?

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:54.690
Mom, dad— could you bend down a little bit?

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.190
Why?

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.360
Hurry!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:20:59.610
Sure.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:32.520
It's the Sea Breeze!

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:46.200
It's just like how it used to be.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:48.280
Why?

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:51.660
Would you like some lemonade, miss?

00:21:58.290 --> 00:21:59.240
Delicious!

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:00.710
Just like back then.

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:03.380
Disgusting— just like it used to be!

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:09.800
You're also the same as back then, Akane-san.

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:22.570
The boy and the girl were dad and mom?

00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:27.450
What a fascinating twist of fate.

00:22:27.450 --> 00:22:29.950
Have you learnt how to swim, miss?

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:32.700
Nope, not at all!

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:35.290
Did you manage to become a cameraman?

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:38.420
I didn't have talent.

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:41.040
Even though you took so many great pictures?

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:45.210
I can't photograph anything besides 
this town and the people here very well.

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:54.680
That's why I decided to stay here 
and keep taking pictures of this town.

00:22:55.970 --> 00:22:57.360
I want to ask you something.

00:22:57.360 --> 00:22:59.100
Are you happy now?

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:00.940
Yes, very much so.

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:04.650
Congratulations.

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:14.780
Yurie?

00:23:14.780 --> 00:23:16.620
Mitsue-chan, you came?

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:19.250
Tohru-niichan wanted to come here—

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:22.400
So that was your doing after all?

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:24.250
What's up with those clothes?

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:26.300
Er—

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:27.170
Yurie!

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:30.180
Is something going on over there?

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:32.350
Why—

00:23:32.350 --> 00:23:35.680
Why did I feel I had to come here?

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:48.820
Looks like it'll be another busy day!

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:53.030
Come, show it to everyone else as well.

00:23:54.820 --> 00:23:56.580
Do I have to do it to everyone?

00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:59.250
No no no, I don't want to!

00:23:58.160 --> 00:23:59.000
Yurie?

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:01.790
Oh well, I'll do it then.

00:24:08.380 --> 00:24:10.010
Sorry, Mitsue-chan!

00:24:29.690 --> 00:24:31.820
My, the sea is great, isn't it?

00:24:31.820 --> 00:24:33.280
So wide and grand—

00:24:33.280 --> 00:24:35.530
But if you drown, you die.

00:24:35.870 --> 00:24:38.030
I'm fine, I can fly.

00:24:38.030 --> 00:24:39.040
Not fair!

00:24:57.930 --> 00:24:59.680
Why are they multiplying—

00:25:28.210 --> 00:25:34.280
<b>The last class of the day never seems to end</b>

00:25:34.280 --> 00:25:39.150
<b>Even if I keep glancing at my watch, a second seems an eternity</b>

00:25:40.150 --> 00:25:46.190
<b>In the radiant schoolyard, trailing your running visage,</b>

00:25:46.190 --> 00:25:51.360
<b>my imagination is running wild about our date after class</b>

00:25:52.260 --> 00:25:55.280
<b>The school chimes ring and it's a signal of love!</b>

00:25:55.280 --> 00:25:58.270
<b>Be careful if you rush out into the hallway!</b>

00:25:58.270 --> 00:26:01.240
<b>I dash to see you, first thing!</b>

00:26:01.240 --> 00:26:03.860
<b>Let's go home together!</b>

00:26:04.840 --> 00:26:11.500
<b>Sharing a soda-flavored popsicle under the glaring sun</b>

00:26:11.500 --> 00:26:17.540
<b>My youth seems to melt with it, it makes my heart beat faster</b>

00:26:17.540 --> 00:26:23.010
<b>I'm shutting our casual time in my heart</b>

00:26:23.310 --> 00:26:30.400
<b>Tomorrow I will love you even more than today</b>

00:26:35.780 --> 00:26:38.200
The next episode will be Wild Times!

00:26:38.200 --> 00:26:43.160
A catfight is some-meow 
breaking out at a late night arena!

00:26:43.580 --> 00:26:48.710
Representing humans and gods, 
I will put on cat ears and join in!
